```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Cliente]) -->|HTTP Request| Gateway[API Gateway]
    
    Gateway -->|Routing| Dispatch{Método HTTP?}
    
    %% GET Endpoints
    Dispatch -->|GET /challenges| GetAll1["GET ALL<br/>- Scan table<br/>- Filter by level?<br/>- Paginate"]
    Dispatch -->|GET /challenges/random| GetRnd1["GET RANDOM<br/>- Scan all<br/>- Filter by level?<br/>- Pick one"]
    Dispatch -->|GET /challenges/ID| GetOne1["GET ONE BY ID<br/>- Query by id<br/>- Return item"]
    
    Dispatch -->|GET /dice| GetAll2["GET ALL<br/>- Scan table<br/>- Filter level?<br/>- Filter diceType?"]
    Dispatch -->|GET /dice/random| GetRnd2["GET RANDOM<br/>- Scan with filters<br/>- Pick random"]
    Dispatch -->|GET /dice/ID| GetOne2["GET ONE BY ID<br/>- Query by id<br/>- Return item"]
    
    %% POST Endpoint
    Dispatch -->|POST| CheckPost{Body is<br/>array?}
    CheckPost -->|Single item| ValidateCRUD["VALIDATE<br/>- Check required fields<br/>- Validate level<br/>- Validate diceType"]
    CheckPost -->|Array| BulkCreate["BULK CREATE<br/>- Batch writer<br/>- Validate each<br/>- Track errors"]
    
    ValidateCRUD --> GenUUID["NORMALIZE<br/>- Generate UUID<br/>- Add timestamps<br/>- Trim strings"]
    BulkCreate --> GenUUID
    
    GenUUID --> CreateItem["CREATE ITEM<br/>- Put in DynamoDB<br/>- Log success"]
    
    %% PUT Endpoint
    Dispatch -->|PUT| UpdateValidate["VALIDATE<br/>- Item must exist<br/>- Validate level<br/>- Validate diceType"]
    UpdateValidate --> UpdateTS["ADD TIMESTAMP<br/>- Set updatedAt<br/>- Keep createdAt"]
    UpdateTS --> UpdateItem["UPDATE ITEM<br/>- UpdateExpression<br/>- Only changed fields<br/>- ConditionExpression"]
    
    %% DELETE Endpoint
    Dispatch -->|DELETE| CheckExists["CHECK EXISTS<br/>- Query by id<br/>- Must exist"]
    CheckExists --> DeleteItem["DELETE ITEM<br/>- Remove from DB<br/>- Return success"]
    
    %% Response
    GetAll1 --> Response["📊 Response"]
    GetAll2 --> Response
    GetRnd1 --> Response
    GetRnd2 --> Response
    GetOne1 --> Response
    GetOne2 --> Response
    CreateItem --> Response
    UpdateItem --> Response
    DeleteItem --> Response
    
    %% Error Handling
    Gateway -->|Bad Request| Error400["❌ 400<br/>Bad Request"]
    Dispatch -->|Unknown Method| Error405["❌ 405<br/>Method Not Allowed"]
    ValidateCRUD -->|Invalid| Error400
    UpdateValidate -->|Not Found| Error404["❌ 404<br/>Not Found"]
    CheckExists -->|Not Found| Error404
    GenUUID -->|DB Error| Error502["❌ 502<br/>Database Error"]
    CreateItem -->|DB Error| Error502
    UpdateItem -->|DB Error| Error502
    DeleteItem -->|DB Error| Error502
    
    Response -->|JSON + CORS| End([Cliente])
    Error400 --> End
    Error404 --> End
    Error405 --> End
    Error502 --> End
    
    style Gateway fill:#ff9900
